1
00:00:09,180 --> 00:00:11,340
This is how I'll become.

2
00:00:13,040 --> 00:00:15,180
This is how I'll become.

3
00:00:18,320 --> 00:00:19,840
Supreme Commander.

4
00:00:20,300 --> 00:00:21,220
A hero!

5
00:00:21,820 --> 00:00:23,720
This is my story!

6
00:00:52,300 --> 00:00:53,700
Let's go.

7
00:00:58,300 --> 00:01:02,157
I've seen my dreams.

8
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:04,837
I've never been to you.

9
00:01:04,920 --> 00:01:09,677
It's the only way I've been to you.

10
00:01:09,760 --> 00:01:13,260
I've been to you.

11
00:01:19,580 --> 00:01:23,260
I've been to you?

12
00:02:06,340 --> 00:02:09,693
Hey, there's something that
I've been wanting to ask you.

13
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:15,020
Did Yachiho do any
training to prep for today?

14
00:02:19,320 --> 00:02:21,673
Anything you can tell me would be great.

15
00:02:25,800 --> 00:02:26,820
Wake up!

16
00:02:32,560 --> 00:02:35,678
Yauchiho hasn't been acting
any different than usual.

17
00:02:35,980 --> 00:02:38,098
Actually, she's been in a good mood.

18
00:02:38,900 --> 00:02:41,782
Guess that means she
doesn't expect much, Himari.

19
00:02:44,220 --> 00:02:45,700
Is everyone ready?

20
00:02:47,140 --> 00:02:51,200
Now let the first match begin! Beacon!

21
00:02:51,740 --> 00:02:53,900
Don't say I didn't warn you.

22
00:02:54,060 --> 00:02:55,825
You won't last a second again.

23
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:01,640
Where the hell did that come from?

24
00:03:03,540 --> 00:03:04,820
Golden Hour!

25
00:03:05,760 --> 00:03:06,940
Five seconds!

26
00:03:13,900 --> 00:03:14,730
Beacon!

27
00:03:15,440 --> 00:03:16,460
She's tired.

28
00:03:16,860 --> 00:03:19,937
We planned ahead in case we couldn't
beat her with a single blow.

29
00:03:20,020 --> 00:03:21,667
Let's stick to our strategy!

30
00:03:28,160 --> 00:03:30,440
A gun modified for use in Mato.

31
00:03:30,800 --> 00:03:32,976
I knew that would be her main weapon.

32
00:03:33,080 --> 00:03:36,397
Leaping into the air where she's
a sitting duck was a dumb move.

33
00:03:36,480 --> 00:03:40,304
When she starts coming down, I'll
use Golden Hour to freeze time.

34
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:43,560
And blast her!

35
00:03:46,520 --> 00:03:47,520
Do it now!

36
00:03:50,220 --> 00:03:51,300
Ah!

37
00:04:00,240 --> 00:04:01,320
Ah!

38
00:04:04,760 --> 00:04:06,620
Time for golden hour!

39
00:04:11,020 --> 00:04:12,196
Rewind five seconds!

40
00:04:20,020 --> 00:04:22,200
An airborne kick to gain momentum?

41
00:04:22,560 --> 00:04:24,795
She really cut it close with that one.

42
00:04:25,660 --> 00:04:29,460
But if I activate my
ability sooner than planned,

43
00:04:29,760 --> 00:04:33,172
they'll be moving into my
attack range when I freeze time!

44
00:04:33,880 --> 00:04:35,000
Golden hour!

45
00:04:40,080 --> 00:04:41,700
Freeze for five seconds!

46
00:04:43,740 --> 00:04:45,280
No, where did it go?

47
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:49,980
You're out of range.

48
00:04:50,440 --> 00:04:52,400
She's changing tactics on me.

49
00:05:02,720 --> 00:05:05,060
Yes, we made her waste her ability.

50
00:05:05,580 --> 00:05:07,677
Stand your ground and stick to the plan.

51
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:08,590
Roger that.

52
00:05:13,180 --> 00:05:14,760
Whoa, incredible.

53
00:05:15,280 --> 00:05:17,045
Faster than his fading bullet!

54
00:05:17,380 --> 00:05:19,417
Is Himari trying to confuse her opponent?

55
00:05:19,500 --> 00:05:21,800
She's running circles around Yachi-ho!

56
00:05:23,320 --> 00:05:25,060
I can feel it in my bones.

57
00:05:25,500 --> 00:05:28,265
I can feel how desperately
Himari wants to win.

58
00:05:28,800 --> 00:05:30,329
As for my ultimate goal...

59
00:05:32,060 --> 00:05:34,354
I want to be a hero like the commander.

60
00:05:35,060 --> 00:05:39,413
I feel like I'll become a better version
of myself if I can beat Yachi-ho.

61
00:05:40,680 --> 00:05:42,420
I have to help her win!

62
00:05:42,700 --> 00:05:43,980
I'll make sure of it!

63
00:05:47,980 --> 00:05:49,720
Yeah, you got this!

64
00:05:50,100 --> 00:05:52,100
It's almost like I'm seeing devil!

65
00:05:59,960 --> 00:06:00,840
Do it!

66
00:06:09,960 --> 00:06:12,740
You petulant little brat! Nice.

67
00:06:13,060 --> 00:06:14,357
We threw her off balance.

68
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:19,657
Just like we planned they certainly
came prepared didn't they?

69
00:06:19,740 --> 00:06:22,057
It's shaping up to be a good match.

70
00:06:22,140 --> 00:06:26,237
Do you think that Yachiho
will be okay I assumed

71
00:06:26,320 --> 00:06:28,657
his servitude was reserved
exclusively for Kyo?

72
00:06:28,740 --> 00:06:34,520
But it seems he's capable of devoting
himself to a new master too interesting.

73
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:43,600
This man I mean Yuki he's busting his
ass for me more than I expected him to.

74
00:06:44,500 --> 00:06:47,735
I'll have to apologize for
giving him such a hard time.

75
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:51,529
That's just another reason why
I've got to destroy Yachi-ho!

76
00:06:51,960 --> 00:06:54,725
Golden Hour can't be
activated instantaneously.

77
00:06:55,080 --> 00:06:57,297
The trigger is that dumb pose of hers.

78
00:06:57,380 --> 00:07:00,297
So depending on our position
when she starts to move,

79
00:07:00,380 --> 00:07:02,792
it's our cue to either attack or retreat.

80
00:07:04,640 --> 00:07:09,464
And we can tell whether or not she already
used her ability based on her behavior.

81
00:07:09,740 --> 00:07:13,517
If she's tired all of a sudden,
it's proof that she rewound time.

82
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:16,776
Then we change things up and
hightail it out of there.

83
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:28,457
It's a drain on her energy so
she can only use her ability

84
00:07:28,540 --> 00:07:31,497
a few more times at best if
we can make her waste it.

85
00:07:31,580 --> 00:07:32,992
We're guaranteed to win!

86
00:07:33,420 --> 00:07:36,657
I bet that's exactly what he
Maria is thinking right now.

87
00:07:36,740 --> 00:07:40,797
I figured out her logic and her
strategy I'll drag her back home

88
00:07:40,880 --> 00:07:45,920
and make her life a living hell
Guess it's time to play my trap card!

89
00:07:47,480 --> 00:07:50,960
Feel the power of your big sister!

90
00:07:51,560 --> 00:07:54,560
She's going to freeze time,
but we're safe at this!

91
00:07:56,520 --> 00:07:57,660
Prime time!

92
00:08:00,940 --> 00:08:02,800
Freeze for ten seconds!

93
00:08:14,320 --> 00:08:17,940
If it were only five, she'd
be out of my attack range.

94
00:08:18,400 --> 00:08:21,560
But with a ten-second head
start, she can't escape!

95
00:08:40,240 --> 00:08:41,880
What just happened?

96
00:08:43,880 --> 00:08:47,409
Himani turned up the heat, but
now she's down for the count!

97
00:08:52,400 --> 00:08:53,280
Prime time!

98
00:08:53,880 --> 00:08:58,174
By striking the ultimate pose, I double
the amount of time I can control.

99
00:08:59,360 --> 00:09:03,360
The only downside was that it took
a few seconds longer to activate.

100
00:09:04,960 --> 00:09:06,237
But at that distance,

101
00:09:06,320 --> 00:09:09,017
I knew you would try
to dodge my attack if I

102
00:09:09,100 --> 00:09:11,747
made a show of getting
into my majestic pose.

103
00:09:14,520 --> 00:09:16,500
Whoa, can you believe it?

104
00:09:16,700 --> 00:09:18,340
Double the golden hour?

105
00:09:18,540 --> 00:09:22,540
That means Yachihou must have frozen
time for an entire ten seconds!

106
00:09:22,920 --> 00:09:25,480
But how were you able...

107
00:09:26,860 --> 00:09:30,700
A genius such as I only gets
more brilliant over time.

108
00:09:30,940 --> 00:09:34,352
Not including that in your
calculations was your downfall.

109
00:09:51,040 --> 00:09:52,697
To be

110
00:09:52,780 --> 00:09:59,780
continued

111
00:10:11,060 --> 00:10:11,890
Command!

112
00:10:12,020 --> 00:10:14,120
Well, he might be all right.

113
00:10:17,280 --> 00:10:19,600
It ain't over yet! Stand up!

114
00:10:19,780 --> 00:10:22,977
Now's the time to show him what
the seven squadrons made of!

115
00:10:23,060 --> 00:10:24,000
Hang in there!

116
00:10:24,100 --> 00:10:24,930
Let's go!

117
00:10:25,013 --> 00:10:25,843
You got it!

118
00:10:27,060 --> 00:10:31,017
When her learning ability acquires
another that comes with a cost attached,

119
00:10:31,100 --> 00:10:34,453
she can't execute a skill
switch until the price is paid.

120
00:10:34,780 --> 00:10:37,900
That's why she can't just
change abilities mid-match.

121
00:10:39,040 --> 00:10:41,337
You need to think back to the past.

122
00:10:41,420 --> 00:10:44,797
You were never up to snuff when
it was something important.

123
00:10:44,880 --> 00:10:47,617
This time is no different.

124
00:10:47,700 --> 00:10:50,857
You don't have a way
to counter prime time.

125
00:10:50,940 --> 00:10:53,280
Just give up and concede.

126
00:10:57,700 --> 00:10:59,177
Is it happening again?

127
00:10:59,260 --> 00:11:01,757
Were all my efforts in vain?

128
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:06,837
Hey, you know she's trying
to psych us out. Right?

129
00:11:06,920 --> 00:11:10,717
Yuki, look at your sister's face.

130
00:11:10,800 --> 00:11:13,457
That ability took a toll on her.

131
00:11:13,540 --> 00:11:14,737
She's exhausted.

132
00:11:14,820 --> 00:11:16,837
She probably can't use it again.

133
00:11:16,920 --> 00:11:22,597
Quitting when we're this close to victory?

134
00:11:22,680 --> 00:11:26,117
I'd be ashamed if My master
did something that stupid.

135
00:11:26,200 --> 00:11:29,217
You're clearly running
out of steam as well.

136
00:11:29,300 --> 00:11:33,000
And you've got a A smart
mouth for a damn slave.

137
00:11:35,220 --> 00:11:37,220
I'll punish you when this is over!

138
00:11:39,800 --> 00:11:40,840
She's up!

139
00:11:41,400 --> 00:11:46,106
It looked like the end of the line for
Himari, but she's back on her feet again!

140
00:11:46,380 --> 00:11:49,420
Could we be approaching
the grand finale at last?

141
00:11:49,580 --> 00:11:50,740
Oh, hell yeah!

142
00:11:53,680 --> 00:11:56,260
Aw, she managed to stand up.

143
00:11:58,600 --> 00:12:00,780
No more of this shameful behavior.

144
00:12:01,140 --> 00:12:03,217
You don't want to
embarrass your commander.

145
00:12:03,300 --> 00:12:07,947
I could easily freeze time again and
staying strong and fighting to the finish.

146
00:12:09,220 --> 00:12:12,514
It's never considered shameful
for the seventh squadron.

147
00:12:13,480 --> 00:12:16,837
I thought breaking your spirit now
would make it easy to train her later,

148
00:12:16,920 --> 00:12:19,840
but do what we practice. You got it.

149
00:12:20,500 --> 00:12:21,520
Golden hour.

150
00:12:27,040 --> 00:12:30,240
I can't see, but I already struck a pulse!

151
00:12:30,460 --> 00:12:31,931
Breathe for five seconds!

152
00:12:32,780 --> 00:12:34,440
It's time to end this!

153
00:12:36,160 --> 00:12:36,990
What?

154
00:12:40,700 --> 00:12:42,340
I can't see Himari!

155
00:13:11,700 --> 00:13:14,500
I had no idea that you were so desperate.

156
00:13:22,100 --> 00:13:23,380
Can it be?

157
00:13:37,620 --> 00:13:39,237
It's all over!

158
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:41,260
Himari Azuma is the winner!

159
00:13:41,860 --> 00:13:44,331
That's one point for the seventh squadron!

160
00:13:45,280 --> 00:13:49,197
They used the flash and smoke from Yuki's
reverse transformation to blind her.

161
00:13:49,280 --> 00:13:50,240
Not bad.

162
00:13:50,620 --> 00:13:52,177
You two really did your research.

163
00:13:52,260 --> 00:13:53,820
My goodness!

164
00:13:54,240 --> 00:13:56,160
Poor Yachiho lost the match!

165
00:13:56,340 --> 00:14:00,046
Let's think of it as an opportunity
to learn from her mistakes.

166
00:14:05,320 --> 00:14:07,020
Yuki! Still down!

167
00:14:09,340 --> 00:14:10,920
There's no need to worry.

168
00:14:19,280 --> 00:14:21,277
Did we... beat her?

169
00:14:21,360 --> 00:14:24,419
Yeah, but you lost consciousness
after getting shot.

170
00:14:27,080 --> 00:14:29,937
Ordinarily, injuries like these
would be life-threatening.

171
00:14:30,020 --> 00:14:34,844
But since you've sustained them inside my
barrier, they'll heal up as good as new.

172
00:14:36,340 --> 00:14:37,170
There!

173
00:14:37,253 --> 00:14:39,414
You're all clear to move around freely!

174
00:14:41,760 --> 00:14:42,780
That's amazing!

175
00:14:43,100 --> 00:14:44,380
It's already gone!

176
00:14:46,620 --> 00:14:47,500
Get off!

177
00:14:48,100 --> 00:14:49,717
She said you're back to normal.

178
00:14:49,800 --> 00:14:51,517
You've got no excuse to lean on me.

179
00:14:51,600 --> 00:14:53,357
Hey, you don't have to be so rough.

180
00:14:53,440 --> 00:14:55,780
I was unconscious until 30 seconds ago.

181
00:15:00,440 --> 00:15:01,700
We actually did it.

182
00:15:06,960 --> 00:15:09,700
Now that I can relax,
I feel really thirsty.

183
00:15:10,080 --> 00:15:12,080
Well, you did do a lot of running.

184
00:15:22,040 --> 00:15:25,760
Our timing on that one was
absolutely perfect i know right

185
00:15:29,960 --> 00:15:35,097
I remember you catching a nasty cold right
before entrance exams because you worked

186
00:15:35,180 --> 00:15:41,080
Yourself too hard i thought you were an
overachiever and you were pretty naive but

187
00:15:45,480 --> 00:15:48,960
Let's go get something to drink
I worked up a thirst, too.

188
00:15:49,260 --> 00:15:50,436
Hold it right there!

189
00:16:04,240 --> 00:16:05,946
You've gotten a lot stronger.

190
00:16:06,060 --> 00:16:07,140
I'll admit that.

191
00:16:07,780 --> 00:16:09,780
I'll treat you better from now on.

192
00:16:10,140 --> 00:16:12,900
Are you ready to join
the Azuma family again?

193
00:16:15,820 --> 00:16:17,720
Come back home with me, Himari?

194
00:16:20,180 --> 00:16:21,010
Yachiho

195
00:16:22,260 --> 00:16:25,340
The 7th Squadron Is my home now?

196
00:16:27,280 --> 00:16:30,574
There's nothing you could say
To convince me to go back!

197
00:16:33,160 --> 00:16:37,437
Come on, let's get out of
here Yeah Oh my goodness!

198
00:16:37,520 --> 00:16:42,980
Poor Yachiho She's just got an
unconventional way of expressing her love.

199
00:16:44,140 --> 00:16:46,140
Come on, let's go get you changed.

200
00:16:46,240 --> 00:16:47,070
There, there.

201
00:16:47,153 --> 00:16:48,234
You don't need to cry.

202
00:16:59,900 --> 00:17:00,730
Finally.

203
00:17:02,580 --> 00:17:03,410
Huh?

204
00:17:20,100 --> 00:17:21,180
What was that?

205
00:17:22,160 --> 00:17:23,520
Was that my reward?

206
00:17:25,660 --> 00:17:27,220
I guess it's starting.

207
00:17:30,680 --> 00:17:32,445
Let's go over the first match.

208
00:17:33,040 --> 00:17:34,620
Pay attention, Yachi-ho.

209
00:17:37,200 --> 00:17:41,377
I have been told this was the little
slave's first fight against a human.

210
00:17:41,460 --> 00:17:43,197
He knew your wounds would heal,

211
00:17:43,280 --> 00:17:47,317
but there's a chance he subconsciously
put the brakes on his attacks.

212
00:17:47,400 --> 00:17:51,753
If that's true, then the first direct
hit would have killed you instantly.

213
00:17:52,000 --> 00:17:54,118
Something to consider in the future.

214
00:17:56,340 --> 00:17:57,634
That's not all either.

215
00:17:58,240 --> 00:17:59,181
After primetime,

216
00:17:59,460 --> 00:18:04,048
it was foolish to allow your opponent a
reprieve instead of finishing her off.

217
00:18:04,240 --> 00:18:06,005
Never underestimate the enemy.

218
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:08,700
Okay, I understand.

219
00:18:10,160 --> 00:18:11,720
Now about that boy,

220
00:18:11,920 --> 00:18:16,200
the way he kept pushing and using
himself as a decoy at the last second.

221
00:18:17,220 --> 00:18:19,440
That's a slave, like no other.

222
00:18:23,160 --> 00:18:24,840
Imari's taking a long time.

223
00:18:25,300 --> 00:18:27,760
Should I check on her and Mr. Yuki?

224
00:18:28,040 --> 00:18:29,697
Oh, I wouldn't mind getting them!

225
00:18:29,780 --> 00:18:33,486
I worked up quite a thirst after
all that cheering that we did.

226
00:18:33,660 --> 00:18:35,057
Your match starts soon.

227
00:18:35,140 --> 00:18:37,257
Be careful not to drink too much water.

228
00:18:37,340 --> 00:18:38,170
Copy that!

229
00:18:39,380 --> 00:18:41,262
Himari pulled out all the stops.

230
00:18:41,440 --> 00:18:44,440
I want to try and impress
Yuki with my skills, too.

231
00:18:48,240 --> 00:18:49,220
Because of you?

232
00:18:50,060 --> 00:18:51,700
I was able to beat her.

233
00:18:51,920 --> 00:18:54,038
I couldn't have done it without you.

234
00:18:54,700 --> 00:18:56,160
I appreciate it.

235
00:18:57,760 --> 00:18:58,590
Himari.

236
00:19:00,960 --> 00:19:05,195
I want you to know that I'm not just
saying that as part of your reward.

237
00:19:08,880 --> 00:19:10,260
I really mean it!

238
00:19:21,660 --> 00:19:23,117
What was that?!

239
00:19:23,200 --> 00:19:24,357
It wasn't my choice!

240
00:19:24,440 --> 00:19:25,597
I was forced to do it!

241
00:19:25,680 --> 00:19:27,097
I thought that was obvious!

242
00:19:27,180 --> 00:19:30,100
I swear to God, your reward is so obscene!

243
00:19:40,180 --> 00:19:41,677
Himari's got a sharp tongue.

244
00:19:41,760 --> 00:19:43,517
But her lips.

245
00:19:43,600 --> 00:19:46,557
Her lips are unbelievably soft.

246
00:19:46,640 --> 00:19:48,357
Wait, hold on?

247
00:19:48,440 --> 00:19:50,760
Are you sure about not going back home?

248
00:19:51,520 --> 00:19:52,350
Positive

249
00:19:52,820 --> 00:19:56,880
The commander helped me out in tough
times I'll never leave her side

250
00:20:04,300 --> 00:20:05,130
Look

251
00:20:10,020 --> 00:20:10,850
Look.

252
00:20:10,933 --> 00:20:12,677
I know I've been kind of cruel to you.

253
00:20:12,760 --> 00:20:13,590
I'm sorry.

254
00:20:13,673 --> 00:20:15,140
Maybe boys aren't so bad.

255
00:20:20,520 --> 00:20:22,500
Thanks a lot, Miss Himari.

256
00:20:22,780 --> 00:20:24,017
Can you chop the miss?

257
00:20:24,100 --> 00:20:26,177
Given the circumstances, it feels weird.

258
00:20:26,260 --> 00:20:28,837
But kissing is the price of
the ability and nothing more,

259
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:30,277
so don't get the wrong idea.

260
00:20:30,360 --> 00:20:31,960
I am fully aware of that!

261
00:20:42,100 --> 00:20:45,280
